    <briefdescription>
<para>Gauss-Jacobi integration. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class performs a 1-dimensional Gauss-Jacobi integration. <formula id="196">\[ \int_{-1}^{1} f(x) \mathrm{d}x \]</formula> The weighting function is <formula id="197">\[ w(x;\alpha,\beta)=(1-x)^\alpha (1+x)^\beta \]</formula> </para>    </detaileddescription>
